# Build-context hygiene for the feature-002 intent-tier images (build context: repo root).
# Host-side virtualenvs and caches must never be baked into the images: the
# build-time `uv sync --frozen --no-dev` venv created inside the image is the
# only environment the tier runs on, and a host .venv copied over it would
# shadow it with dangling symlinks (see agents/README.md "Pins and build").
agents/.venv/
agents/.pytest_cache/
agents/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
